{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"38d0d3fa6bac5801f4e10bbcb789d40f9330cb20b350d8ff2ff73361865c890c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"922c0f9665c0bf5f6510312a19d45e7e51e8bb06527542c30e1c71a82564891b","logical_entry_identity":"ddacce7e5822a2e0e4ad8bcad32a9d16fa0aca24ded4835ddd23bd1b6002e398","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"cleaved","source_tag":"_t","target":"被裂颅"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"07bd95efabb32c8ea8dab6422429080be42d0ef0565cb3fa9b8bc62cb139c28b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9235907da340dea161cf0024b11fc50ed38709dc7e222c0867640c056fbdaf51","logical_entry_identity":"da92b75920453c2ac678ba8ca404a51ca2a4f44567c29fc62f6772916488d5d2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Let hate fuel your movements. While active, you gain %d%% movement speed. The recklessness of your movement brings you bad luck (Luck -3).\n\t\tCleave, Repel and Surge cannot be active simultaneously, and activating one will place the others in cooldown.\n\t\tSustaining Surge while Dual Wielding grants %d additional Defense.\n\t\tMovement speed and dual-wielding Defense both increase with the Willpower stat.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"让杀意激发你敏捷的身手，提高你 %d%% 移动速度。不顾一切的移动会带给你厄运（-3 幸运）。\n\t\t分裂攻击、杀意涌动和无所畏惧不能同时开启，并且激活其中一个也会使另外两个进入冷却。\n\t\t双持武器时，杀意涌动还会提高你 %d 的闪避。\n\t\t移动速度和双持时的闪避增益受意志加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2a4371e5cb627320eb8e4fda7eb9d2b38e0f1b749a1ff37df50f22dd2cdba04e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"923be7c13fb67682ad44239ff8e5dc4e2cc884a8832af0c845c565753a791021","logical_entry_identity":"38b505955ddaa5f86dae5d5d43f9f89710082078c28c3d74514e2f4a7fd9abb4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You hit a foe with your mainhand psiblade doing %d%% weapon damage, channeling all the damage done through your offhand psiblade with which you touch a friendly creature to heal it.\n\t\tThe maximum heal possible is %d. Equilibrium of the healed target will also decrease by 10%% of the heal power.\n\t\tMax heal will increase with your Mindpower and Mindstar power (requires two mindstars, multiplier %2.f).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你用主手心灵利刃攻击敌人造成 %d%% 武器伤害，用副手心灵利刃传导敌人所受的伤害能量来治疗友方单位。\n\t\t治疗最大值为 %d。受到治疗效果的目标失衡值会降低治疗量的 10%%。\n\t\t最大治疗值受精神强度和灵晶强度加成（需要 2 只灵晶，加成比例 %2.f）。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5ad40f7acfa7ae9784dda71e3c5831dc084a7ebd5a46942f9feed023e5ca616b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"923e0207b41e73329f803529c9328f6845d214ae38132f4f0c3a1855e5447795","logical_entry_identity":"0538f3d583eff87871fc813b66a46fafd4136120648d8132982f6e36f098a779","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Are you sure you want to enter? There's no telling where you will end up or if you will be able to make it back.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你确定要进去么？没人知道这会把你带到哪里，你也无法知道你是否还能设法返回。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"59fb3bf19a277a4030642de4c6c7230850554ca2f77b70ee65ca7ecf78e12be0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"92407172333d74cc0bbb46c670ee9182ad291807c97253f1692061bb75bed474","logical_entry_identity":"7aaa9080ca36f654abb4d77fa70b3990fdf79b4c534a61ccb8d0d05779fba2bd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Deep Bellow excavation report 1","source_tag":"_t","target":"深渊咆哮挖掘报告 1"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f5d24a92c506b99e57b5c271d9c9bcecb751773661360696cb21caacbc9aa7e0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"924174787554598cccc4f4299c4b0052aa222f78a10131b0b815837e10b272a2","logical_entry_identity":"4a69b723bc09ac4643e0f3fdc70fa235d1c18d2144f42da5bb77332a66c07df6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The Blood of Life seems to have no effect on you.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"生命之血对你似乎没有什么作用。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"81a4b4b3f8695325abb97855f84721384456ef8843c55f6d547e98192bb35dac","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9247184ba44afff682a577a97ce7d53b95ba718ce4aa0a51fb8a044ee3e1b8a8","logical_entry_identity":"73a20ac942fc41ddccb68fc4147ad9c5e067