directly from Angolwen. Despite, you know, the whole thing with the Spellblaze, people still enjoy a few magic tricks!\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*She snaps her fingers, and then flames start dancing around her!*#WHITE#\nFryjia told me about you, the poor thing, so I will not underestimate such a promising aspirant #LIGHT_GREEN#*She smiles warmly* #WHITE#So, let's make haste my dear!\nThere is a battle to fight here!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*大门开启，一名身着深红长袍的成年女子出现在门后。\n#LIGHT_GREEN#她灿烂地微笑着看向你*\n#WHITE# 哎呀，哎呀，多出色的一位 @playerdescriptor.race@ 啊。你叫什么来着，@playername@？今天能成为你的对手，我可真是太高兴了。\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*她压低声音，仿佛在说一个秘密* #WHITE#你知道吗，最近能闯过那个小家伙的人实在太少了，真是无聊透顶。#LIGHT_GREEN#*她咯咯轻笑*#WHITE#\n那么！我就是绯红里娅拉，刚从安格利文赶来。虽说嘛，魔法大爆炸闹出了那些事，但人们还是喜欢看点魔法把戏！\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*她打了个响指，火焰随即在她周围起舞！*#WHITE#\n弗里嘉已经跟我说过你了，可怜的孩子。所以，我绝不会低估你这样前途无量的挑战者。#LIGHT_GREEN#*她温暖地微笑着* #WHITE#那么，亲爱的，我们赶快开始吧！\n这里还有一场战斗等着我们！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a4b6dede20b3330b02fb54d45facc5a4f485b1a02260d06db2b78b3dffef215d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"926d166627394205715e2e9fee61d7598939cd5685683fc2bf8000f5e939eca3","logical_entry_identity":"758da2165b11fe030d91003fdb101e240bcf5679594c50da4088c226348d6728","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"deeprock","source_tag":"talent type","target":"深岩形态"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fd6329d921679e1cba77b6911bbeb147d8efebbbd20a17c11d632b36834fcf5b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"927097b4b99a60e6c77f903c1ed6582d8046ba499e92a0fd27f6485c6c40930f","logical_entry_identity":"ea792fa59f4eabc6a585f3b7edfb04a2b5a2681d83520b10074a53782d735ba6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"clue (ruined dungeon)","source_tag":"_t","target":"线索（地城废墟）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f1cc885f58d58ced1859104e9c50d343f1ad6a82054584751461e8478600f26f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"927ad3c70a05605a98054820c683960e096439b7c294cc18ad81283d65822010","logical_entry_identity":"b9eb5d7f1f3cb9a591aa2800938b772fbfecc869084dd2b2fd4a39913954b6dc"